{"parse": {"title": "灵魂影映-06", "pageid": 119381, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E9%AD%82%E5%BD%B1%E6%98%A0-05\" title=\"灵魂影映-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">灵魂影映-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E9%AD%82%E5%BD%B1%E6%98%A0-07\" title=\"灵魂影映-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">灵魂影映</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.87.83.E7.83.A7.E7.9A.84.E5.A4.9C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"燃烧的夜\">燃烧的夜</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 燃烧的夜</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Night It Burned</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>就这样，伟大的血食怪野树莓开始团结起更多的伙伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>他们将一同对抗黑暗，对抗永恒的沉眠……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>他们快要成功了！当然，命运给予血食怪的考验远远不止如此。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_gongmu_ye\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_gongmu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>你们聚在这里干什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>现在是全城宵禁！平民夜间不得出行！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>把手都举起来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑洞洞的枪口举了起来，对准了手无寸铁的平民。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>一个一个走过来，不许跑！都给我老实点！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>异乡的侵略者要借着火光，看清他们的脸上有没有反抗的痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>哼……可疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>还未等他们走近这些人，随着一声短促的笛声，一道黑影扫了过来，快得所有人都没有看清。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>什么东西！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>跑——！！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>快跑——！！！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3\"><img alt=\"3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3.png/600px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3.png/900px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>树上传来一声女孩的大喊，比枪声更惊人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们停滞了一下，因这撕心裂肺的吼叫——来自一个瘦弱的孩子。他们拼命迈开腿，不顾那危险的枪口，四散着逃开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>在树上！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>朝树上开枪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>枪声四起，然而那黑色的异物遮蔽了持枪者的视线，子弹失去了方向，对着天空飞去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>不行，看不清了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>……别让他们跑了！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_gongmu_ye\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_gongmu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当他们终于明白影子只是影子，并没有任何实体，那些平民已经在混乱中逃走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>混账！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>头儿，这些应该全是他们的家人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>呕……全都烂了，真恶心！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>他们一直在这里守着？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>坟地里充满腐朽的气息，士兵们粗鲁地用脚摆弄着地上那些面目全非的尸体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>点火。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>全都烧了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>将溃烂的身体堆在一起，点燃的火柴先是燃烧布料，再是头发、皮肤……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火苗腾升成大火，浓烟滚滚，吞没了洁白的月光。坟地被映得一片血红。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>等他们回来，和你们团聚吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_xuesemuyuan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-627411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-627411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-627411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的母亲：</div><div>米列娜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-627411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-627411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-627411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的母亲：</div><div>孩子，妈妈对不起你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-629501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-629501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-629501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去亲人的孩子Ⅰ：</div><div>妈妈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去孩子的父亲：</div><div>一群魔鬼……一群混账……他们会下地狱的……我的彭卡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去亲人的孩子Ⅱ：</div><div>爷爷，火又烧起来了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去亲人的孩子Ⅱ：</div><div>像他们烧我们的屋子和土地一样……他们又烧死了你和妹妹……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-629601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">失去亲人的孩子Ⅱ：</div><div>他们烧尽了一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空气之中弥漫着哀伤，或是仇恨，或是痛苦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她逃进山林之中。腾升的大火燃烧家人的身体。火光直冲天空，坟场犹如炼狱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>他们无法烧去血食怪的灵魂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>不管多大的火，都无法烧尽血食怪的灵魂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩的声音虚弱，语气却十分坚定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>就算失去身体，也无法毁灭他们的全部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>因为他们的灵魂已经进入影子里，影子是不会被破坏的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-638220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-638220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-638220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>“他们在血色的月光下复生，永远游走在黑夜的阴影里……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>“他们的世界是自由的，没有死亡，也没有恐惧……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>“只需饮下鲜血，他们便将永世长存。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将笛子放在嘴边，火光在她的脸上跳动着，配合着这闪烁，她吹出曲调。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑色的影子出现了，一个，两个，三个……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们沉默地林立，以另外一种形式，留在亲人的身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笛声像一首哀曲，哀悼人们逝去的身体，以及残破的故土。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "灵魂影映-06"}}